      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites</strong> At least one arcane or occult innate spell gained from a gnome heritage or gnome ancestry feat</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You are attacked by a foe</p>\n<hr />\n<p>The magic within you manifests as a natural reaction to threats. You gain the effects of <em>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.j8vIoIEWElvpwkcI]{Mirror Image}</em> but with two images instead of three. The tradition of this action matches the tradition of your gnome ancestry options.</p>",
